# Chinese translations for the Site UI developer guide.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: HybridInference\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

msgid "For the operator-facing capability matrix and upgrade paths, see the [Distribution customization guide](distribution-customization.md). This page describes the public UI interface, not a general extension API for every page."
msgstr "面向发行版维护者的能力表和升级路径，请参阅[发行版定制指南](distribution-customization.md)。本文说明公开 UI 接口，不提供任意页面的通用扩展 API。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:1
msgid "Site UI API v1 — the seam that lets a distribution own its public pages"
msgstr "Site UI API v1：让发行版拥有自己的公开页面"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:3
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:5
msgid "A distribution may need its own public pages while sharing the console and account controllers. Site UI provides that extension point without adding product-specific components or runtime switches to the shared application. The neutral build keeps the existing pages when no module is selected."
msgstr "发行版可以拥有自己的公开页面，同时共用控制台和账号控制器。Site UI 提供这一扩展点，无需在共享应用中加入特定产品的组件或运行时开关。未选择模块时，中立构建保留现有页面。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:10
msgid "The seam"
msgstr "扩展接口"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:12
msgid "One Next.js application, one console, one session. A distribution ships a small UI module; the build compiles it in."
msgstr "一个 Next.js 应用、一个控制台、一套会话。发行版提供一个小型 UI 模块，由构建过程编译进应用。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "The host keeps"
msgstr "宿主保留"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "The module owns"
msgstr "模块负责"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the gateway, the console, `/dashboard`, `/chat`, `/team`, `/authorize`, `/agents`"
msgstr "网关、控制台、`/dashboard`、`/chat`、`/team`、`/authorize`、`/agents`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`/` and the six account/legal routes"
msgstr "`/` 以及六个账号与法律条款路由"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the auth controllers: schemas, submit calls, error codes, `next` handling"
msgstr "认证控制器：数据结构、提交请求、错误码与 `next` 处理"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the frame, the field classes and the wording those pages display"
msgstr "这些页面的外壳、字段样式类和文案"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the session store, the signup policy, the field set, the proxy rules"
msgstr "会话存储、注册策略、字段集合与代理规则"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "its own stylesheet, assets and model-family presentation"
msgstr "自己的样式表、资源与模型系列展示"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`AuthField` / `AuthNotice` / `AuthLoading` and their ARIA contract"
msgstr "`AuthField` / `AuthNotice` / `AuthLoading` 及其 ARIA 契约"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "where the heading and a field action sit"
msgstr "标题与字段操作的位置"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:29
msgid "A module may import `@site-ui/host`, `react`, `next/*` and its own files. Anything else — in particular `@/...` — fails the build."
msgstr "模块可以导入 `@site-ui/host`、`react`、`next/*` 和自己的文件。其他导入，尤其是 `@/...`，会使构建失败。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:32
msgid "`site_ui_api` is a revision number. A module written for one revision is not compiled against another; the build stops instead."
msgstr "`site_ui_api` 是接口版本号。针对某一版本编写的模块不能按另一版本编译；版本不符时构建会停止。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:35
msgid "Resolution: one answer, three toolchains"
msgstr "模块解析：三套工具使用同一个结果"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:37
msgid "Webpack, `tsc` and Vitest must agree on which module was compiled in, or a distribution build's test run asserts against the neutral UI while the build ships the distribution's. `src/site-ui/resolve.js` is the single decision, and it writes three artefacts the three tools follow:"
msgstr "Webpack、`tsc` 和 Vitest 必须对编译进应用的模块达成一致，否则发行版测试会检查默认 UI，而构建产物却包含发行版 UI。`src/site-ui/resolve.js` 统一做出选择，并写出三套工具共同遵循的三个产物："

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "Artefact"
msgstr "产物"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "For"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "Ignored by git"
msgstr "是否由 git 忽略"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`src/site-ui/active/{client,server}.ts`"
msgstr "`src/site-ui/active/{client,server}.ts`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "Webpack, through the `@site-ui/*` alias"
msgstr "Webpack，通过 `@site-ui/*` 别名访问"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`src/generated/distribution-ui/manifest.json`"
msgstr "`src/generated/distribution-ui/manifest.json`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "build provenance and tests"
msgstr "构建来源记录与测试"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`tsconfig.generated.json`"
msgstr "`tsconfig.generated.json`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`npm run type-check`"
msgstr "`npm run type-check`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:48
msgid "An **absent** extension compiles the neutral UI. A **present but unusable** one fails the build — a missing entry, a missing export, a wrong API revision, a missing `SITE_UI_API`, or an import outside the promised surface. Silently publishing another design's home page is worse than a failed build."
msgstr "扩展 **未配置** 时编译默认 UI。扩展 **已配置但不可用** 时构建失败，例如入口缺失、导出缺失、API 版本错误、未指定 `SITE_UI_API` 或导入了接口之外的内容。不能在构建成功后悄悄发布另一个设计的首页。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:53
msgid "Toolchain constraints"
msgstr "工具链约束"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:55
msgid "Next.js uses Webpack aliases for the generated entries. TypeScript maps the client entry directly to the selected module and the server entry to a generated facade, which supplies the default locale when the module omits it."
msgstr "Next.js 通过 Webpack 别名引用生成的入口。TypeScript 将客户端入口直接映射到所选模块，将服务端入口映射到生成的接口层；模块省略语言设置时，该接口层提供默认值。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:59
msgid "The import verifier distinguishes executable imports from comments and code samples inside strings. `src/site-ui/verify-imports.test.ts` covers these cases and rejects imports outside the supported facade and framework packages."
msgstr "导入校验器会区分可执行导入、注释及字符串中的代码示例。`src/site-ui/verify-imports.test.ts` 覆盖这些情况，并检查是否拒绝受支持接口层和框架包以外的导入。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:63
msgid "Chrome ownership"
msgstr "页面外壳归属"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:65
msgid "Getting this wrong produces two headers or none. Exactly one layer draws `<header>` / `<main>` / `<footer>`:"
msgstr "归属错误会导致两个页头或完全没有页头。`<header>` / `<main>` / `<footer>` 必须只由一层绘制："

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "Route"
msgstr "路由"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "Who draws it"
msgstr "负责绘制的部分"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`/`"
msgstr "`/`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the module's `Landing` if provided, otherwise the console page and chrome"
msgstr "模块提供 `Landing` 时由它绘制，否则使用控制台页面与外壳"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the account routes"
msgstr "账号路由"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the module's `AuthFrame` if provided, otherwise the console chrome and neutral card"
msgstr "模块提供 `AuthFrame` 时由它绘制，否则使用控制台外壳与默认卡片"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`/terms`"
msgstr "`/terms`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the module's `TermsFrame` if it exports one, else the console chrome"
msgstr "模块导出 `TermsFrame` 时由它绘制，否则使用控制台外壳"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "everything else"
msgstr "其他路由"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the console chrome, always"
msgstr "始终使用控制台外壳"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:75
msgid "`PublicRouteBoundary` decides by asking what the compiled-in module *provides*, never what the deployment is *called*. `Landing === null` is a real answer: it means \"the console's own page is the right page\", which is what the neutral module declares."
msgstr "`PublicRouteBoundary` 根据编译进应用的模块 *提供了什么* 做决定，不判断部署 *叫什么*。`Landing === null` 表示“控制台自身的页面适合这里”，默认模块正是这样声明的。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:80
msgid "Where the pieces are"
msgstr "代码位置"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "Path"
msgstr "路径"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "What"
msgstr "职责"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`contract.ts`"
msgstr "`contract.ts`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the normative types"
msgstr "规范类型定义"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`routes.ts`"
msgstr "`routes.ts`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the closed route table; a module cannot register a route"
msgstr "封闭的路由表；模块不能注册路由"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`host.ts`"
msgstr "`host.ts`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the only module path a distribution may import"
msgstr "发行版唯一允许导入的宿主模块路径"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`resolve.js`"
msgstr "`resolve.js`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the one resolution decision"
msgstr "统一的模块解析选择"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`verify-imports.js`"
msgstr "`verify-imports.js`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "keeps a module on the promised import surface"
msgstr "确保模块只使用接口承诺的导入范围"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`neutral/`"
msgstr "`neutral/`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the default UI, itself written against the contract"
msgstr "同样按照契约编写的默认 UI"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`SiteUiBoundary.tsx`"
msgstr "`SiteUiBoundary.tsx`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "installs the module and renders the route it owns"
msgstr "安装模块并渲染其负责的路由"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`PublicRouteBoundary.tsx`"
msgstr "`PublicRouteBoundary.tsx`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "selects chrome from the components the module supplies"
msgstr "根据模块提供的组件选择页面外壳"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`terms-sections.tsx`"
msgstr "`terms-sections.tsx`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "the legal text, shared by both frames"
msgstr "两个外壳共享的法律条款正文"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "`tests/fixtures/site-ui-demo/`"
msgstr "`tests/fixtures/site-ui-demo/`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:0
msgid "a second, deliberately tiny module"
msgstr "刻意保持精简的第二个模块"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:95
msgid "`tests/fixtures/site-ui-demo/` is not a template. It exists so the interface can be tested against something the host has never seen — if it ever needs a host change to keep working, the interface has grown a dependency on one design, and that is the bug."
msgstr "`tests/fixtures/site-ui-demo/` 不是模板。它让接口接受一个宿主此前未见过的实现检验。如果需要修改宿主才能让它继续工作，就说明接口依赖了某一种设计，这正是要避免的问题。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:100
msgid "Testing the seam"
msgstr "验证扩展接口"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:102
msgid "The shared repository owns validation and the image recipe. These checks use the built-in neutral module and the public example."
msgstr "共享仓库负责校验和镜像构建配方。这些检查使用内置中立模块和公开示例。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:112
msgid "`resolve.test.ts` covers module selection and invalid declarations; `SiteUiBoundary.test.tsx` and `chrome.test.tsx` cover shared primitives and chrome ownership; `verify-imports.test.ts` checks the import boundary. The tests in `scripts/site-ui/prepare-module.test.ts` exercise staging, asset merging and bundle validation."
msgstr "`resolve.test.ts` 覆盖模块选择与非法声明；`SiteUiBoundary.test.tsx` 和 `chrome.test.tsx` 覆盖共享组件及外壳归属；`verify-imports.test.ts` 检查导入边界。`scripts/site-ui/prepare-module.test.ts` 的测试验证模块暂存、资源合并与产物完整性。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:118
msgid "From the repository root, build the neutral image and the public example through the same upstream recipe:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录使用同一份上游配方构建默认镜像与公开示例："

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:131
msgid "The first manifest must report `kind: \"neutral\"`; the second must report `id: \"example\"`. The **Site UI Containers** CI job builds these two shapes and checks the example asset over HTTP. These image builds need Docker and network access for dependencies. Serving the full application also needs the gateway's runtime `/site-config` endpoint."
msgstr "第一个清单必须报告 `kind: \"neutral\"`，第二个必须报告 `id: \"example\"`。**Site UI Containers** CI 任务会构建这两种镜像，并通过 HTTP 检查示例资源。这些构建需要 Docker 以及下载依赖的网络连接。完整应用运行时还需要网关提供 `/site-config` 端点。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-api.md:137
msgid "For local module staging, development-server selection and returning to the neutral UI, follow [Local development](site-ui.md#local-development). Those commands use the same resolver as the image build and type checker."
msgstr "本地模块暂存、开发服务器模块选择及恢复默认 UI 的方式见 [本地开发](site-ui.md#local-development)。这些命令与镜像构建、类型检查使用相同的解析器。"
